  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Do-Hwa has spent his whole life seeing ghosts, but turning thirty brings a terrifying new \"gift\": a body that acts as a magnet for possession. His birthday wish for a quiet life goes up in smoke when a virgin lust-demon hitches a ride in his body and immediately goes on the hunt for a \"good time.\" The target? Mu-Yeong, a man with looks to die for and a temper to match. Unfortunately for the demon, Mu-Yeong isn't just a bystander, he’s a Grim Reaper. After a swift exorcism, Do-Hwa is left mortified and staring into the eyes of a Reaper who suddenly finds this \"human magnet\" very interesting.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
